Task 1: Hotel Room Booking Management System
Objective
Develop a Spring Boot application using Spring Data JPA to manage hotel room bookings and
perform searches using Or and Between finder methods.
Database Table: Booking
bookingId - Long
guestName - String
roomType - String
city - String
bookingAmount - Double
numberOfDays - Integer
bookingDate - LocalDate
bookingStatus - String
Insert Sample Data
Insert at least 10 booking records into the database.
Repository Interface
BookingRepository extends JpaRepository<Booking, Long>
findByCityOrRoomType(String city, String roomType);
findByBookingAmountBetween(Double minAmount, Double maxAmount);
findByNumberOfDaysBetween(Integer minDays, Integer maxDays);
findByBookingStatusOrCity(String status, String city);
findByBookingDateBetween(LocalDate startDate, LocalDate endDate);
findByGuestNameOrBookingStatus(String guestName, String status);
findByRoomTypeOrBookingStatus(String roomType, String status);
findByBookingIdBetween(Long startId, Long endId);
CommandLineRunner Operations
1. Chennai or Suite.
2. Amount 5000-15000.
3. Days 2-5.
4. Confirmed or Hyderabad.
5. Dates 2026-01-01 to 2026-03-31.
6. Anita or Cancelled.
7. Deluxe or Pending.
